 ht between the lure of hyper-convenient processed foods\, the overwhelming
  task of preparing home-cooked meals\, and the emotional undercurrents tha
 t shape how and why we eat.\n\nJoin us for a three-part series designed to
  help you understand and reshape your eating habits through a lens of biol
 ogy\, practicality\, and mindfulness. We’ll begin by exploring how the m
 odern food environment is designed to override our natural signals and cre
 ate c\n\nAges: All ages\nSource: https://healthyliving.stanford.edu/classe
 s/register/class_detail.php?t=1cce34dfd3cbss383d348a508b1be48cc821&ci=1252
